  <p>Annual averages smooth out intra-year volatility and confirm the structural breakpoints: sub-$3 in the early 1970s, a sharp step-up to $10+ following the 1973 embargo, the 1986 reset, the 2000s supercycle to a peak annual average of $105/bbl (2012), and the post-2014 era of heightened oscillation between $40 and $100.</p>
